/P 162 0 R
/E (But I hadn't realized that it bore me as much as I bore it. It held me together. And now I've been unraveled. I am forced to stare at my soul as it is, naked. There's no quashing my own urges because there's nothing that needs to be done before a deadline. I'm forced to sit alone with myself, and it's scary. I'm forced to be eye to eye with this shell of my former self. )
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
406 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 162 0 R
/E (For weeks, I was plagued by this sense of purpose, this heavy stone pressing against my sternum. It was a burden I dreamt of shedding one day, spending days upon days lying uselessly, with nothing to do. Sweet release of aimlessness. And now that I am finally free of it, I don't feel free at all. The pressure is gone, and there's nothing to drive me anymore.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [3]
>>
