/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 163 0 R
/E (Upon a closer inspection, the anger seems to be questioning me. What are you worth without the grades to prove it? Is overworking yourself the only way you would ever be valued? Is exhaustion the price of being human? And if it isn't, then what have you been running after for so long? Chasing the ghost of success, thrashing your own desires and feelings. And I don't have the answers to her questions. Not yet. But this is the first time in a while that I've paid attention to her opinion about her own life. Maybe she doesn't expect answers. Maybe she just wants me to stay. To listen to her drowned out voice, as if it's coming from underneath an ocean.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
