/E (The museum was elaborate with 8 beautiful and ancient collections. They had an entire Quran collection, with scripts dating back to 1500 AH. Other collections included artifacts from ancient civilizations like Gandhara and Indus. While exploring the place I had this strange sense of vertigo, when I realized I was standing in a room full of possessions of ancient people, people who lived thousands of years ago, and that the cost for this experience is just 20 rupees. Yes, you read that right, the entry ticket to the museum was just a mere 20 rupees, holding history itself inside its rooms yet people walked past without a single glance.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
420 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 165 0 R
