<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 165 0 R
/E (For the past 2 years, once every week, during my route through the Saddar roads, I would pass by these beautiful buildings, sitting quietly in their reserved plots with a bored watchman standing on duty as other people walked past on their way to somewhere more important. I was one of them, always absorbed in my own worries, fighting down the nausea as I stood in a crowded bus. I could spare these sites nothing more than a glance. Curious, always, but too occupied to find out.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [4]
>>
