/Title (I've always had a knack for dramatics and my team truly gets it. This issue was meant to be a dramatic explosion of emotions and they delivered. From the depressing "casualties of 17" to knowing "we are infinite", it's a beautiful journey. I am forever grateful to the beautiful writers and the overworked design team. Y'all are my heroes.)
